  "details": "IDK how it could possibly be related but others have told me they noticed this issue as well.\nI am hot micing a lot more often than I used to be, no matter how low I set my volume both in Windows and in VRC.\nIt seems that the noise gate trigger was adjusted in the VRC app or something.\nI don't know if that's the case but it certainly runs as if the gate was set at -infinity almost. It does turn off but just barely.\nI have to turn my mic to basically inaudible in order to not hot mic.\n(Both on my headset and with a good podcast condenser mic.)\nHope that's descriptive enough.\nLMK if you need details or logs.",
